  "title": "Wabtec Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release Date",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, March 30, 2026 -- Wabtec Corporation (NYSE: WAB) announced it will report 2026 first quarter results before the U.S. financial markets open on April 22, 2026. The company will conduct a conference call to discuss those results with analysts and investors at 8:30 a.m. ET the same day.",
